### Activate invite on device
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/auth/invites/activate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "ABCD-EFGH-1234",
  "device_fingerprint": "ios-device-hash"
}

### Send register code
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/auth/send-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "purpose": "register",
  "captcha_token": "pass-captcha",
  "device_fingerprint": "ios-device-hash"
}

### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "verification_code": "123456",
  "device_fingerprint": "ios-device-hash",
  "first_name": "Ivan",
  "last_name": "Ivanov",
  "nickname": "@ivan",
  "recovery_ciphertext": "base64-ciphertext",
  "recovery_meta": {
    "kdf": "argon2id",
    "salt": "base64"
  }
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "verification_code": "123456",
  "device_fingerprint": "ios-device-hash"
}

### Create upload session (file)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/uploads
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "file",
  "file_name": "video.mov",
  "mime_type": "video/quicktime",
  "total_size": 123456789,
  "chunk_size": 1048576
}

### Upload chunk
PUT http://localhost:8080/v1/uploads/{{upload_id}}/chunks/0
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./chunk-0.bin

### Complete upload
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/uploads/{{upload_id}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Cancel upload
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/uploads/{{upload_id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Attachment metadata
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/attachments/{{attachment_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Attachment download
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/attachments/{{attachment_id}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Send encrypted message with attachment
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/chats/{{conversation_id}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message_type": "file",
  "body_ciphertext": "base64",
  "body_nonce": "base64",
  "body_tag": "base64",
  "attachment_id": "{{attachment_id}}",
  "metadata": {
    "file_name": "video.mov"
  }
}

### Report message
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/chats/{{conversation_id}}/messages/{{message_id}}/report
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "spam",
  "note": "Suspicious phishing text"
}
